{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "59bc9fa98556fc9b3b871bc4540a662148c64e1d7ea8a42450c52e55cd5292bf", "ja": "（美奈子と奈緒のライブイベントが迫ってきた。\n美奈子の様子はどうかな……？）", "zh": "（美奈子和奈绪的现场活动就要开始了。美奈子现在怎么样了呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "bcaafb06eb9a322d91a2940929eb03e6830a32304a5a7342d0907724fc964adf", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "af05aca3689b09535dda63ecb20ef652459a396d1652c5e8e442b9d3d7131f20", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま……？\n美奈子、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "啊，辛苦了……？\n美奈子，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "6fce951c2592ae75d674482558ea15095f1b10c8c479521eb41b7ec8b813994c", "ja": "何がですか？", "zh": "怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ac4a994255793c8e31223206dd6f8fcefbcee52e7560575bd67bfe3d9e04347f", "ja": "いや、顔色が悪いというか、表情がなんだか……\nもしかして、体調でも悪いのか？", "zh": "没有，就是觉得你脸色不太好，表情也总觉得有点……\n难道是身体不舒服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6adf16100725b9f42ce4ee89187a76b92dce4fedb41a021f5a36cd71ab128f37", "ja": "それとも、もしかして……\n人気投票で奈緒と競ったのが、そんなに……？", "zh": "还是说，难道是因为在人气投票中和奈绪竞争的事，真的那么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "febef8e01e7dd3ea368b0cd25db6bd23ed7d81c92c40ed3184477afb28d89402", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい、そうじゃないんです！\nビックリさせちゃいましたか？", "zh": "啊，对不起，不是那样的！\n吓到您了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "04cab24e4b45971cda1379932f251a58f8397733d5affc725ac8ef7092547a3c", "ja": "体調が悪いわけじゃなくて、その……\n笑わない練習をしてただけなんです。", "zh": "不是身体不舒服，只是那个……\n我刚才只是在练习不笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1b24a297b44d5277a1035dde4c995bcf30e816d285f7c7bee2413ef35bfa983f", "ja": "笑わない練習？", "zh": "练习不笑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "1e06e236c603e4218ef00448517f4e1f4f6c73d32aad2035f695f4f372c25752", "ja": "はい！　今回のユニットのテーマは、『トレンドを\n発信し続ける女子のカリスマ！』なんですよね？", "zh": "是的！这次组合的主题是“持续引领潮流的女性魅力代表”对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "9bfb3a3ee9de817e02f5fee0a7599dd25d5db85cd9aeff6b2c67e4d19d09a4f4", "ja": "衣装も歌も、カッコイイ感じだし。だから私も、\nなるべく笑わないほうがいいのかな？って。", "zh": "服装和歌曲都是那种帅气的感觉。所以我想，我是不是也最好尽量不要笑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1011_p", "source_sha256": "68c3eaa4a7d53d602a065508f63eff14ad8d0a8c13751a5d264c732c22dfe83f", "ja": "なんだ、そうだったのか。\n美奈子はいつも笑顔だから、びっくりしたよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。美奈子总是面带笑容，真让我吃了一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "2e88e72c33bbc499fbad02d5fa8e4398e4bdd689d542e69218ac66537d598171", "ja": "そっか。私って、いつも笑顔なんですね！\nそれって、すごく幸せなことなのかも……？", "zh": "这样啊。原来我总是在笑呢！\n那或许是一件非常幸福的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "47a50d9c41ec082934b4ca46dd357c2bfba771a7bf76f65b98e83ec76f256d4b", "ja": "あっ、もちろん悩みがないわけじゃないですよ？\n今回の人気投票のことだって、すっごく悩みましたし。", "zh": "啊，当然也不是没有烦恼哦？\n这次的人气投票，我也烦恼了好久呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "071477cca6c308698d3a44f2c4549245295bbc11bb155b32bf45b693948f1ce9", "ja": "でもいつも、{$P$}さんが\n背中を押してくれるから。私、がんばれるんです！", "zh": "不过一直都是{$P$}先生在背后推我一把，我才能坚持下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1015_p", "source_sha256": "65f0b7d0d33d1f1362f7cab21965b5c3cc2d80a259ed22146e6494ef3fc73f6b", "ja": "はは、そうか。美奈子が笑顔になれるなら、\n背中を押した甲斐があったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。只要能让美奈子露出笑容，我推你一把也就值得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "2378926a0fd915c044cbc201fb639b68cee284737dee10f411d99db3b7657fcf", "ja": "はい！　なのでこれからも、私が立ち止まったり\nうつむいたりしてたら、思いっきり押してくださいね！", "zh": "好的！所以今后如果我停下脚步或垂头丧气的话，请用力推我一把哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "baa13375b04881d5484669c8c9317640a9dfa874a09be6f9651ba9bf5f305fdc", "ja": "それだけで私、わっほーい！って\n元気になっちゃいますから♪", "zh": "光是这样，我就会“哇呼——！”一下子打起精神来啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0ad9dd39496e1e33cfc8f7628073979010b5c389572640d4a13efad6d211d53f", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。美奈子にはいつも、\nたくさん元気にしてもらってるからな。", "zh": "啊，当然了。因为美奈子总是让我充满活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7c25243ac46e79ffa9ec5def64c20eeb8b2e4e8a5921e87e3f1e6eaa5e8239d7", "ja": "美奈子に元気がない時は、\nちゃんとお返しするよ。約束する！", "zh": "美奈子没精神的时候，我一定会好好回报你的。约好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "2c7c396df4f7308517350cb6162a6ba31cbf613cf38aa88260ac1cde056846b7", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ。\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0153_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "055f36fd9001030579ad9fb5ad7ff1ceee8e083e8ff23ba529b5f08b05e1b86c", "ja": "あっ、でもクールな表情も練習しなくちゃですよね！\nえっと……うう、笑顔からだと、難しい……。", "zh": "啊，不过酷酷的表情也得练习才行呢！\n那个……呜，从笑脸开始练的话，好难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
